                    108.0,
                    305.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "8.6(f) If the temporarily-recalled employee begins within one (1) year of the original layoff effective date, eligibility for coverage for medical/dental insurance, life insurance, accidental death and dismemberment insurance, business travel accident insurance, long-term and short-term disability insurance, and voluntary personal accident insurance begins on the first day of the month following the month in which the re-employment commences. If the temporarily-recalled employee begins at least one (1) year after the original layoff effective date, eligibility for coverage for such benefits begins the first day of the month following one (1) full calendar month of continuous employment.",
            "block_bbox": [
                108,
                322,
                712,
                460
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
